OL,3,GNEWSAThieves cause patient delays at
OL,4,Amobile CT scanner
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 150 patients have had their
OL,7,Fappointments postponed after thieves
OL,8,Fstole copper cable from a mobile lung
OL,9,Fcancer CT scanner.
OL,11,FThe Tees Valley screening programme
OL,12,Fuses the scanner to detect the disease
OL,13,Fin patients in the area, which has the
OL,14,Fhighest rate of cases in the country.
OL,16,FThieves have targeted the scanner -
OL,17,Fwhich has detected 460 cases of the
OL,18,Fdisease - several times across Teesside
OL,19,Fand the service has had to be paused
OL,20,Fwhile repairs are carried out.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
